        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` now returns 10 measurements (L1316-1447; Pass 3 list L1343-1394): the 5 Pass 2 values plus the 3D WT lumen ratio (0.3229 vs 0.305 empirical, Law 4 analytic 0.3229), rupture pressure P_crit (0.115 vs Laplace bound 0.510), HES7 period (4.995 vs 5.0 h), boundary spacing (100.0 vs v T = 99.9 um) and the oldest-somite live-coupled ratio (0.3033 vs 0.305). Deductions: three of the five new references are model-internal (Laplace bound, v T, calibration target) and the period measurement validates its own calibration, as the reference_source strings themselves say (L1359-1383) (-7); the 3D ratio misses the only empirical anchor by 6% with no stage-resolved somitocoel data digitised from Yamanaka Figs. 2-3 or Miao Fig. 4 to test the S0 -> S-III series (L1384-1393) (-3); the specimen reference 47.1429 px is the disputed scout value (-2)." ;
